  "reportes.nota.luz.faltan.otros": "Missing: {faltantes} of {esperados} bills for the period, so the electricity cost you see is INCOMPLETE and the margin looks better than it will end up. A month without a bill is not a month without consumption: it is data nobody has recorded yet.",
  "reportes.nota.luz.faltan.uno": "Missing: {faltantes} of {esperados} bill for the period, so the electricity cost you see is INCOMPLETE and the margin looks better than it will end up. A month without a bill is not a month without consumption: it is data nobody has recorded yet.",
